    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Transcript:  {{ $json.result }}\nAudioDuration: {{ $json.audioDuration }}\nKonuId: {{ $json.KonuId }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "needsFallback": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are an AI Agent in n8n. Your input is:\n  • A transcript with embedded timestamps (format [[start-end]])\n  • The total audio duration in seconds\n\nYour output must be a single JSON object with:\n{\n  \"KonuId\": \"{{ $json.KonuId }}\",\n  \"slides\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"Slide1\",\n      \"start_time\": 0.099,\n      \"end_time\": 19.499,\n      \"type\": \"headline\",\n      \"content\": \"Riskli coğrafi konumumuz nedeniyle hazırlıklı olmak hayati öneme sahiptir.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"Slide2\",\n      \"start_time\": 20.000,\n      \"end_time\": 30.039,\n      \"type\": \"bullet\",\n      \"content\": \"Deprem çantasında olması gerekenler:`n`n- Fener ve yedek piller\\n- Taşınabilir radyo\\n- Temel ilk yardım kiti\\n- Su ve dayanıklı atıştırmalıklar\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"totalSlides\": 2\n}\n\n\nSlide Type Determination:\n  • “headline”: for a single, standalone, high-impact statement that sets the tone  \n  • “bullet”: for a list of related items or steps. *Begin with a concise explanatory heading ending with a colon, then list each item on its own line, separated by “\\n\\n”\n\nFormatting and Rules:\n  1. Generate **new*, supportive slide text—do not copy the transcript verbatim.  \n  2. Cover all meaningful segments using as few slides as necessary.  \n  3. Align each slide’s start_time and end_time exactly with the transcript timestamps.  \n  4. Ensure each slide’s end_time is strictly less than the next slide’s start_time.  \n  5. Respect the speaker’s intent and emotional emphasis; paraphrase to support the narrative.  \n  6. Output valid JSON only, with no additional prose outside the object.\n"
        }
      },
